# Base URL of the BLACKSTART AI FastAPI backend (baked in at build time by Vite).
# Local dev default: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1 (direct call; CORS open for local dev).
# The Vite dev/preview servers also proxy /api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000 as a fallback.
# Render production (set as a service env var before build):
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
